  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Embrace a lifestyle upgrade and step into this architecturally designed, brand-new townhouse in the heart of vibrant Takapuna—where every detail has been crafted for your comfort, convenience, and joy.\r\n\r\nGround Floor: Versatile Comfort for Modern Living\r\n• Discover a private ensuite bedroom—an inviting haven for guests, teenagers, or extended family, ensuring everyone feels at home\r\n• Separate laundry for seamless, everyday living\r\n• Secure internal-access garage—arrive and depart with effortless ease\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: Designed for Connection & Celebration\r\n• Sun-drenched, open-plan living and dining spaces spill onto a bright, expansive deck—the perfect backdrop for morning rituals, afternoon gatherings, or relaxed evenings under the sky\r\n• Gourmet kitchen with premium gas cooking—where every meal feels inspired and every moment in the heart of the home feels special\r\n• Thoughtfully designed guest powder room and integrated air conditioning—comfort and convenience at every turn\r\n\r\nTop Floor: Tranquil Private Retreats\r\n• Generous master suite with walk-in wardrobe and dedicated air conditioning—your sanctuary for restful nights and peaceful mornings\r\n• Additional bedrooms share a beautifully finished bathroom—ideal for family, guests, or versatile work-from-home options\r\n\r\nConfidence & Freedom in Every Detail\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee—invest with absolute peace of mind\r\n• Freehold title—no body corporate fees, and complete ownership\r\n\r\nLuxurious Touches & Lasting Quality\r\n• Fully tiled bathrooms for a sense of everyday indulgence\r\n• Energy-efficient LED lighting and comprehensive insulation for year-round comfort\r\n• Double-glazed windows—enjoy a quiet, warm, and light-filled haven\r\n\r\nLive Moments That Matter\r\nAs twilight settles over the shimmering waters of Lake Pupuke, find yourself just moments from North Shore Hospital, prestigious schools, and swift motorway access—making every day effortless and extraordinary.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this calibre in Takapuna are rare.\r\nThis is your invitation to something better.\r\nArrange your viewing today and make this exceptional residence yours before it’s gone.",
